  "description": "A room full of Klatooinian butchers all take notice as the beskar-clad figure cuts his pathway through. In the back room, the Mandalorian presents a tracking fob and reveals that he is looking for a man named Kaba Baiz. Placing a puck on the table, it is clear that Baiz is the man that sits right in front of him. The options Mando gives are familiar ones. \"I can bring you in warm, or I can bring you in cold\". With that, the room erupts into a fight. The Mandalorian draws the Darksaber and clears the room, but not before taking a little piece off his own leg."
